<BaseLayout
  title="About Dr. Aayush Shrestha | Orthopaedic Surgeon Nepal"
  description="Learn about Dr. Aayush Shrestha’s education, orthopaedic and spine surgery focus, professional affiliations and approach to patient care in Nepal."
  canonical="https://draayushshrestha.com/about.html"
  active="about"
>
  <main id="main">
    <section class="shell page-hero"><p class="kicker">About the doctor</p><h1>Dr. Aayush Shrestha</h1><p>An orthopaedic and spine surgeon with more than 15 years of experience in orthopaedic care.</p></section>
    <section class="section section--tight"><div class="shell split"><div class="split__copy"><h2>Education and focused training</h2><p>Dr. Shrestha attended Bishop Cotton School in Shimla, India, completed his MBBS at the University of Dhaka and earned his master’s degree in Orthopaedic Surgery from Kathmandu University.</p><p>He completed a spine surgery fellowship at Grande International Hospital, affiliated with Spine Health International in Florida, and has also trained in endoscopic spine surgery. He has more than 15 years of experience in orthopaedic care and currently practises as an orthopaedic and spine surgeon at Grande International Hospital.</p></div><figure class="split__media split__media--portrait"><img src="assets/images/doctor-studio.jpg" width="667" height="1000" fetchpriority="high" alt="Portrait of Dr. Aayush Shrestha"></figure></div></section>
    <section class="section section--paper-2"><div class="shell split split--reverse"><div class="split__copy"><h2>Clinical focus</h2><p>His specialisation is treating conditions of the musculoskeletal system, including musculoskeletal trauma, spine diseases, back pain, neck pain, knee pain, shoulder pain, disc herniation, sports injuries, degenerative diseases and infections.</p><ul class="fact-list"><li>Orthopaedic surgery</li><li>Spine surgery</li><li>Non-operative treatment</li><li>Patient awareness and education</li></ul></div><figure class="split__media"><img src="assets/images/surgery.jpg" width="1080" height="608" loading="lazy" alt="Dr. Aayush Shrestha working with a surgical team"></figure></div></section>
    <section class="section"><div class="shell"><div class="section-head"><h2>Affiliations</h2><p>Grande International Hospital is a multispeciality hospital in Kathmandu. Pacific Multispeciality Clinic provides personalised healthcare in Kupondole, and Shankhamul Healthcare is a multispeciality clinic in Shankhamul, Kathmandu.</p></div><div class="logo-wall"><ul><li><a href="https://grandehospital.com/"><img src="assets/images/grande-hospital.png" width="500" height="500" alt="Grande International Hospital"></a></li><li><a href="https://pacificclinic.com.np/"><img src="assets/images/pacific-clinic.png" width="500" height="500" alt="Pacific Multispeciality Clinic"></a></li><li><a href="https://shankhamulhealthcare.com.np/"><img src="assets/images/shankhamul-healthcare.png" width="892" height="893" alt="Shankhamul Healthcare"></a></li></ul></div></div></section>
    <section class="section section--dark"><div class="shell cta-band"><h2>Know your body</h2><div><p>Read patient education on spine health, joint care, wound care, danger signs, myths and facts.</p><p class="action-block"><a class="btn btn--light" href="patient-guides.html">Explore patient guides</a></p></div></div></section>
    <section class="section section--paper-2 patient-experiences" id="reviews"><div class="shell"><div class="section-head"><h2>Patient experiences</h2><p>Individual experiences vary and do not guarantee treatment outcomes.</p></div><div class="experience-layout"><article class="experience-feature"><blockquote>“Very respectful, professional, dedicated and a caring approach to his patient, colleagues and coworkers. He is knowledgeable and he has a easy way to explain the situation or problems you have come to him for. Experience and expertise, with his mellow nature helps him to assist and advice you. Highly recommended.”</blockquote><div class="experience-person"><img src="assets/images/patient-ojesh.png" width="90" height="90" alt="Ojesh Buddhacharya"><p><strong>Ojesh Buddhacharya</strong><span>Patient · Nepal</span></p></div></article><div class="experience-list"><article class="experience-row"><blockquote>“One of the best orthopedic surgeons in Kathmandu. He is very knowledgeable, well experienced and professional in his field. He is soft spoken and provides a familiar environment for the patients. I would highly recommend Dr. Ayush Shrestha for any issues regarding Orthopedic and Spine case.”</blockquote><div class="experience-person"><img src="assets/images/patient-sabin.png" width="90" height="90" alt="Sabin Maharjan"><p><strong>Sabin Maharjan</strong><span>Patient · Nepal</span></p></div></article><article class="experience-row"><blockquote>“Dr. Aayush is one of the most well-spoken and comforting doctors I’ve ever met. Really takes his time examining and also making the patient understand the situation.”</blockquote><div class="experience-person"><img src="assets/images/patient-arjesh.png" width="90" height="90" alt="Arjesh Karmacharya"><p><strong>Arjesh Karmacharya</strong><span>Grande International Hospital · Nepal</span></p></div></article><article class="experience-row"><blockquote>“Dr. Aayush is one of the most soft spoken doctors I have met in a while. He guided through my problems with enough information in layman’s terms things that I could understand. He guided me through the entire process of my procedure and was with me through out. He has showed outmost compassion and was available even at odd times when I was stressed or had questions. Thank you doctor!!”</blockquote><div class="experience-person"><img src="assets/images/patient-prajali.png" width="90" height="90" alt="Prajali Singh"><p><strong>Prajali Singh</strong><span>Patient · Nepal</span></p></div></article></div></div></div></section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
